      "content": "Be careful with your plan because MAOIs trigger a life-threatening rise in blood pressure when combined with aged cheeses, most cured meats, and soy sauce due to tyramine levels. You should consult your doctor immediately to confirm which specific cheeses and meats are safe for your particular medication and dosage. Focus on fresh proteins like eggs, lean poultry, fish, and fresh yogurt instead to get your protein while avoiding dangerous interactions.",
