      "content": "oh wow i didn't realize it was that serious. i thought it was just maybe some minor indigestion or something. my doctor didn't really mention anything about the food, they just said the meds were important. if i stick to mostly fresh stuff and just have a little bit of the aged stuff once or twice a week, is that okay? i really don't want to give up all the foods i love while i'm trying to feel better.",
